      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Access the Windows node by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ ssh -t -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o ProxyCommand='ssh -A -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no \\\n    -o ServerAliveInterval=30 -W %h:%p core@$(oc get service --all-namespaces -l run=ssh-bastion \\\n    -o go-template=\"{{ with (index (index .items 0).status.loadBalancer.ingress 0) }}{{ or .hostname .ip }}{{end}}\")' <username>@<windows_node_internal_ip>"} lang="terminal" />
