      <h3 id="accessing-windows-node-using-rdp_troubleshooting-windows-container-workload-issues" class="group scroll-mt-20">Accessing a Windows node using RDP<a href="#accessing-windows-node-using-rdp_troubleshooting-windows-container-workload-issues" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
