      Run the following command to set up an SSH tunnel:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ ssh -L 2020:<windows_node_internal_ip>:3389 \\\n    core@$(oc get service --all-namespaces -l run=ssh-bastion -o go-template=\"{{ with (index (index .items 0).status.loadBalancer.ingress 0) }}{{ or .hostname .ip }}{{end}}\")"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
